<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2021/04/generic-tracking-prompt-orange.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-796454" />Apple is facing a £2 billion (&#36;2.7 billion) lawsuit in London accusing it of imposing stricter App Tracking Transparency rules on third party developers than on its own advertising services (via <a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/retail-consumer/apple-facing-27-billion-uk-lawsuit-over-unfair-app-tracking-rules-2026-09-03/"><em>Reuters</em></a>).<br/>
<br/>
